    "detailed_description": "Use Capri's gravity manipulation to slingshot across the universe as she embarks on a mission to liberate a forgotten dimension from the clutches of an all-powerful being. Solve puzzles, uncover mysteries, and shatter space-time itself in this snappy sci-fi action platformer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2347350/extras/078528b2b94790ebeb1f8a0263536651.avif?t=1701302267\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What lies in the dimensions above our own?</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> An original sci-fi narrative set in the far reaches of the universe following Capri's fight to right cosmic wrongs and save <strong>PROJECT: Almagest</strong>.<br></li><li> High-speed movement is interwoven with unique puzzle mechanics sure to engage hypothalamuses and prefrontal cortexes alike.<br></li><li> Galaxy distribution across the universe is dynamic and infinite. Stay conscious, or be lost in the infinite aether.<br></li><li> <i>On The Brink</i> has subtitles available alongside controller support for both Windows and Mac OSX. <br></li><li> Recommended for third-dimensional beings. Playable in the second dimension, with decreased performance.</li></ul>",
